<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia MBf Holdings 6-mth net down.</title>
<headline>Malaysia MBf Holdings 6-mth net down.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to June 30</p>
<p>		    (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		 30.02     vs	30.31</p>
<p>    Shr   (cents)	     4.5	vs	 4.8</p>
<p>    Revenue		   830.23     vs     756.91</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	   62.40     vs	53.64</p>
<p>    Minorities	 less   3.50     vs less  1.71</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries  loss   3.64     vs loss  7.42</p>
<p>Note - MBf Holdings Bhd is involved in financial services, property, trading, manufacturing and motor business.</p>
<p>- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-230 8911)</p>
</text>
